# hooks/

Cross-screen shared hooks for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## What lives here

- Hooks used by multiple screens (`useAppState`, `useColorScheme`, etc.).
- Adapters around RN APIs that screens would otherwise duplicate.

## What does NOT live here

- Screen-local hooks — those live in the screen's own `hooks/` folder.
- Data-fetching hooks specific to one screen — same rule.

## Naming

- File name matches the hook name: `useThing.ts`.
- The hook is a default export only if there is exactly one hook per file;
  otherwise use named exports.

